WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.930
A new kind of drink becomes a craze.

2
00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.370
The first few cafés selling
it can barely keep up.

3
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:10.110
Prices are high, and their
profits are far above normal.

4
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.730
There is no secret recipe,

5
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:13.950
and no rule against copying them.

6
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.120
Anyone can open a café just like theirs.

7
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.350
So when a product is very
profitable and anyone

8
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:23.650
can start selling it,
where do the profits go?

9
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.560
In this mission, you'll follow
one market from the short

10
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.030
run into the long run,

11
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.580
step by step.

12
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.190
Then you'll boost demand
for a product and watch

13
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.060
what happens over time.

14
00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.840
Your mission: find out how long
profits far above normal can last.
